{"id":"n56011-1-8","stage":2,"title":"몰라보다 · 认不出","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56011-1-8-1","ko":"어제 오랜만에 유민이를 만났다며?","zh":"听说你昨天见到了好久不见的裕敏？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이를","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유민이를","audio":"/audio/6c3f3629ff63ff850fa3.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이를","audio":"/audio/6c3f3629ff63ff850fa3.mp3"}},{"text":"만났다며?","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만났다며","audio":"/audio/dae32af3dd24282db2e6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8716c064dff9ac43197.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56011-1-8-2","ko":"응, 몰라보게 예뻐져서 깜짝 놀랐어.","zh":"嗯，她变漂亮了好多，简直认不出来，把我惊到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라보게","meaning":"认不出","explanation":"몰라보다：认不出；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"몰라보다","audio":"/audio/c63743351d86a4945436.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56011","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라보게","audio":"/audio/4ff9102b6620f6674acc.mp3"}},{"text":"예뻐져서","meaning":"漂亮，好看；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예뻐져서","audio":"/audio/c1385a2a1f1fd83596bf.mp3"}},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랐어.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀랐어","audio":"/audio/4fb840d99c407b721374.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行",